  "interpretation": [
    "The independent178-source audit confirms large original-marker/CTC support gaps in OpenAI sources; RMS also finds ten markers over200ms late in that fixed sample. CTC timing is not a phonetic boundary oracle.",
    "Across1959 unique original training standalone sources,56 exceed the unchanged200ms RMS lateness criterion. All56 are currently OpenAI sources; the generic rule does not select by provider.",
    "The previous file-end-only rule covers34 of these sources and misses22, including a sample840ms beyond its RMS endpoint. Existing environmental-only correction also leaves original base views unchanged.",
    "This motivates a separately frozen all-training positive-endpoint ablation. Preserve the original indexes, feature/audio bytes, class labels, source roles and PTQ examples; do not assume quality improvement or deploy it from this audit."
  ]
